cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite the programme paper below."
title: "Post-Flood Diversity Programme"
subtitle: "A quantitative research programme for post-Flood biological diversification"
abstract: >-
  A Lakatosian research programme investigating whether a small preserved
  post-Flood breeding stock can account for observed terrestrial biological
  diversity within specified chronology, genetic constraints, ecological
  processes, and Ark boundary conditions. Current status is a boundary
  specification, not a tested explanation.
type: software
